{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5cd3ccbc3cfe1936","name":"Sniper Blaster Rifle","source":{"id":"source:reference-5cd3ccbc3cfe1936","title":"Sniper Blaster Rifle","revision":25140,"timestamp":"2024-11-12T21:29:03Z","sha256":"282a1d0a7ec1cee7287ee2bef7d0081dc3db890b4b8d9a7dd1a7895757eb9a32","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=25140","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sniper%20Blaster%20Rifle&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5cd3ccbc3cfe1936","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Saga Edition FAQ"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Saga_Edition_FAQ"}," (E27))"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A favorite among assassins and military sharpshooters, the Sniper Blaster Rifle is a powerful and accurate weapon ideal for eliminating targets at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". Unwieldy in anything other than a prepared firing position, the Sniper Blaster Rifle is poorly suited for use in close combat.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you do not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," at your target immediately before making an attack with a Sniper Blaster Rifle, you take a -5 penalty on your attack roll. Sniper Blaster Rifles often have a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bipod"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bipod","referenceId":"reference:f0858f55139d45f9"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"}," mounted on them, but neither is included in the cost listed. A Sniper Blaster Rifle cannot benefit